description-detailed: |
  Investigate Consent to application operations initiated by users or applications. Consent, Add service principal, and Add OAuth2PermissionGrant events should be rare. Correlate audit events using CorrelationId and the initiating account to provide context. This query was renamed from "Daily activity trend by app in AuditLogs" to "Entra ID application consent investigation".
requiredDataConnectors:
  - connectorId: AzureActiveDirectory
    dataTypes:
      - AuditLogs
tactics:
